From 58b5b031dd13e846e80c6369a315468e9d8f0629 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Xiaoyao Li <xiaoyao.li@intel.com>
Date: Tue, 16 Jul 2024 03:13:31 -0400
Subject: [PATCH 76/86] i386/tdx: Fetch and validate CPUID of TD guest

First use KVM_TDX_GET_CPUID to get the CPUIDs that are managed and
enfored by TDX module for TD guest.

Then check the fetched value againt what QEMU is going is to set for TD
vcpus. Error out when mismatched.

Signed-off-by: Xiaoyao Li <xiaoyao.li@intel.com>
---
 linux-headers/asm-x86/kvm.h |  1 +
 target/i386/kvm/kvm.c       | 13 +++++
